      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 132,
      "ruku": 105,
      "hizbQuarter": 53,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 827,
      "text": "There is no moving creature on earth or a bird flying with its two wings, but are communities like you. We have missed nothing in the Record[10], then to their Lord they will be gathered.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 132,
      "ruku": 105,
      "hizbQuarter": 53,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 828,
      "text": "Those who reject Our verses are deaf and dumb in the depths of darkness. Whomever Allah wills, He causes him to stray and whomever He wills, He leads him to a straight path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 132,
      "ruku": 105,
      "hizbQuarter": 53,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 829,
      "text": "Say, “What do you think[11], if there comes upon you the punishment of Allah or the Hour comes upon you, would you then call upon anyone other than Allah, if you are truthful?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 132,
      "ruku": 105,
      "hizbQuarter": 53,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 830,
      "text": "No, it is Him alone you would call upon[12]. If He willed, He could remove whatever harm made you call upon Him, and you would forget whatever partners you associate with Him.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 132,
      "ruku": 105,
      "hizbQuarter": 53,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 831,
      "text": "We sent messengers to nations before you and seized them with poverty and hardship, so that they may humble themselves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 132,
      "ruku": 106,
      "hizbQuarter": 53,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 832,
      "text": "If only they had humbled themselves when Our affliction came upon them, but their hearts were hardened, and Satan made their misdeeds appealing to them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 132,
      "ruku": 106,
      "hizbQuarter": 53,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 833,
      "text": "When they forgot the reminder that they were given[13], We opened for them the doors of everything – until when they rejoiced in pride for what they were given, We seized them by surprise, so they fell into utter despair.",
